{"name":"PSL tier: Chadlite","deep":true,"image":null,"mentions":195,"casual":{"lead":["Chadlite is one of the tiers of the PSL (Perceived Sexual Levels) scale used on looksmaxxing forums. It sits just below Chad and above high-tier normie, and describes a man seen as strikingly good-looking.","The tier works as a target. Members compare their features to the tier, ask whether a given face will reach it after growth or after procedures, and use it to decide which improvements to pursue, such as eyebrows, skin, jaw or body."],"sections":[{"h":"How people use it","paras":["On looksmax.org, users post photos or descriptions and ask for a rating, sometimes with qualifiers such as low, mid or high within a tier. Discussion focuses on features like eye area, jaw, maxilla and facial harmony, and on fixable items such as brows and angles."],"subs":[]},{"h":"Risks & side effects","paras":["The scale is an informal peer rating and not a validated measure. Critics quoted in media describe it as pseudoscientific, tied to incel ideology and potentially harmful to mental health, and a tier label can become a source of distress."],"subs":[]}]},"gallery":[],"links":{"studies":[],"trials":[],"label":null,"reddit":[],"forums":[{"title":"chadlite potential?","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/chadlite-potential.1842537/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20260211150424/https://looksmax.org/threads/chadlite-potential.1842537/"},{"title":"Chadlite? rate","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/chadlite-rate.1534050/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20250916071655/https://looksmax.org/threads/chadlite-rate.1534050/"},{"title":"Chadlite with ltb hook. Yellow fever is too powerful","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/chadlite-with-ltb-hook-yellow-fever-is-too-powerful.1509067/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20260402001211/https://looksmax.org/threads/chadlite-with-ltb-hook-yellow-fever-is-too-powerful.15