it abt","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/which-chad-or-chadlite-should-i-make-an-edit-abt.1788917/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20260103114924/https://looksmax.org/threads/which-chad-or-chadlite-should-i-make-an-edit-abt.1788917/"},{"title":"why the fuck does everyone on tiktok call romulus some bullshit like true adam or chadlite","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/why-the-fuck-does-everyone-on-tiktok-call-romulus-some-bullshit-like-true-adam-or-chadlite.1787063/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20251229150821/https://looksmax.org/threads/why-the-fuck-does-everyone-on-tiktok-call-romulus-some-bullshit-like-true-adam-or-chadlite.1787063/"},{"title":"chico is strong chadlite he aint chad","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/chico-is-strong-chadlite-he-aint-chad.1776749/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20260106113333/https://looksmax.org/threads/chico-is-strong-chadlite-he-aint-chad.1776749/"}],"news":[],"social":[],"web":[{"title":"PSL tier: Chadlite — Grokipedia","url":"https://grokipedia.com/page/Chadlite"},{"title":"Looksmaxxing","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Looksmaxxing"}]},"angle":{"goal":"Overall look","chain":["Compare face and features against the PSL tiers","Identify weak features (brows, jaw, skin, angles)","Target those with looksmaxxing methods to move up a tier"],"effect":"claimed","text":"The tier gives people a concrete goal for facial improvement. Members use rating feedback to decide what to change, such as eyebrow shape or camera angle."},"wikipedia":null,"grokipedia":"https://grokipedia.com/page/Chadlite","lead":["Chadlite is a tier in the PSL scale, one of seven categories from sub-3 to giga Chad: subhuman, low, mid and high-tier normie, Chadlite, Chad and giga Chad [1]. The scale rates facial attractiveness and was created in the 2010s on forums including PUAHate, Sluthate and Lookism.net [1].","Chadlite is the tier immediately below Chad. Users use it to describe a man whose looks stand out but who falls short of the top category; members debate what percentile this represents, with one thread titled as arguing chadlite is not 97th percentile [2][3].","In practice the term is used in rating threads and aspirational questions, such as whether a friend with strong eyes but a slightly recessed mandible might reach it [4]. Members also use it when discussing dating outcomes and when asking about plastic surgery [5][6]."],"infobox":[["Type","Rating tier"],["Scale","PSL (Perceived Sexual Levels)"],["Position","Below Chad, above high-tier normie"],["Origin","PUAHate, Sluthate, Lookism.net (2010s)"],["Rates","Facial attractiveness"]],"sections":[{"h":"Description","paras":["PSL ranks faces on roughly a 1 to 8 range and is meant to reflect how women perceive men [1]. Chadlite is the sixth of seven named tiers [1]."],"subs":[]},{"h":"Origins and spread","paras":["The scale originated on incel-adjacent forums in the 2010s and spread to TikTok in the early 2020s, with media coverage from Vice in 2023 and outlets such as the BBC and the Guardian in 2024 [1]."],"subs":[]},{"h":"In looksmaxxing culture","paras":["Threads ask members to rate faces as chadlite or lower, discuss which traits qualify, and mention a person's potential to reach the tier [3][4]. Members suggest fixing eyebrows and photo angle after reviewing a rating request [3]. Some threads connect the tier to dating, with comments on how women respond to chadlites [5]."],"subs":[]},{"h":"Criticism","paras":["Critics cited in coverage describe the PSL system as pseudoscientific and tied to incel ideology, and note potential harm to mental health [1]."],"subs":[]},{"h":"Clinical studies","paras":["No studies found."],"subs":[]}],"lore":{"intro":"Rating threads treat Chadlite as a benchmark for high attractiveness [3][4].","claims":[{"claim":"Chadlite is a distinct, definable attractiveness tier","verdict":"unknown","note":""}]},"timeline":[{"year":"2010s","event":"PSL scale created on PUAHate, Sluthate and Lookism.net [1]."},{"year":"2023","event":"Vice covers hunter eyes; wider media coverage of looksmaxxing follows [1]."}],"refs":[{"title":"Looksmaxxing","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Looksmaxxing","source":"Wikipedia","year":2026,"type":"encyclopedia"},{"title":"chadlite is not 97th percentile","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/chadlite-is-not-97th-percentile.668999/","source":"looksmax.org","year":2022,"type":"forum"},{"title":"Chadlite? rate","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/chadlite-rate.1534050/","source":"looksmax.org","year":2024,"type":"forum"},{"title":"chadlite potential?","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/chadlite-potential.1842537/","source":"looksmax.org","year":2025,"type":"forum"},{"title":"chadlite and above do women approach you","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/chadlite-and-above-do-women-approach-you.596427/","source":"looksmax.org","year":2022,"type":"forum"},{"title":"chadlite asks for advice on r plasticsurgery","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/chadlite-asks-for-advice-on-r-plasticsurgery.532878/","source":"looksmax.org","year":2022,"type":"forum"},{"title":"Chadlite","url":"https://grokipedia.com/page/Chadlite","source":"Grokipedia","year":2025,"type":"encyclopedia"}],"studies":[],"reddit":[],"forums":[{"title":"chadlite potential?","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/chadlite-potential.1842537/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20260211150424/https://looksmax.org/threads/chadlite-potential.1842537/"},{"title":"Chadlite? rate","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/chadlite-rate.1534050/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20250916071655/https://looksmax.org/threads/chadlite-rate.1534050/"},{"title":"Chadlite with ltb hook. Yellow fever is too powerful","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/chadlite-with-ltb-hook-yellow-fever-is-too-powerful.1509067/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/2026040200